msgid "Daily."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:22 0fcf5aa0363b4bcdb8c5b70d4631b47a
msgid "Why is the bar for the current month so low?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:25 9dd0d3682d7c41fbad63f87623fd7efb
